{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-computing-fundamentals","title":"云计算基础","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":3.53,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.27,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 云计算基础 简介\n\n云计算是当代信息技术基础设施的核心范式，它通过网络按需提供计算、存储和网络资源，从根本上改变了企业和开发者构建、部署与运维软件系统的方式。从最初的虚拟化技术到如今的多云与混合云战略，云计算已经成为数字化转型不可或缺的基础能力。\n\n## 定位与目标读者\n\n本手册面向具有一定系统开发经验的工程师，帮助读者系统掌握云计算的核心概念、架构设计与最佳实践。无论你是刚接触云平台的后端开发者，还是正在规划云迁移方案的架构师，都能从中获得实用的知识体系。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 操作系统基础（进程、内存、文件系统）\n- 计算机网络基本概念（TCP/IP、DNS、HTTP）\n- 至少一种编程语言的实际开发经验\n- 了解 Linux 基本命令行操作\n\n## 内容结构\n\n全书共分为四章，由浅入深地覆盖云计算的关键领域：\n\n第一章**云计算模型**系统梳理 IaaS、PaaS、SaaS 三种服务模型的特征与适用场景，对比公有云、私有云与混合云的部署策略，并深入分析云计算的经济学原理和成本优化方法。\n\n第二章**云服务架构**聚焦云平台的核心服务能力，包括计算服务的弹性伸缩机制、托管服务的平台能力选型，以及云 API 的设计与集成模式。\n\n第三章**云网络**从 VPC 架构与子网规划入手，讲解负载均衡与流量管理的核心技术，并介绍 CDN 与边缘网络的加速策略。\n\n第四章**云存储**覆盖对象存储与数据湖的构建方法、块存储与文件存储的选型依据，以及存储策略与数据生命周期管理。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[云计算模型] --> B[云服务架构]\n    B --> C[云网络]\n    C --> D[云存储]\n```\n\n建议读者按章节顺序学习，先建立云计算的全局认知，再逐步深入各专项领域。在学习过程中结合主流云平台的控制台实操，将理论知识与实际场景紧密结合。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-models","title":"云计算模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"service-models","title":"云计算服务模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-models/service-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deployment-models","title":"云计算部署模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-models/deployment-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cloud-economics","title":"云计算经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-models/cloud-economics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-services","title":"云服务架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-services","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compute-services","title":"云计算服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-services/compute-services"},{"seq":2,"slug":"managed-services","title":"云托管服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-services/managed-services"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cloud-api-design","title":"云 API 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-services/cloud-api-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cloud-networking","title":"云网络","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-networking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-architecture","title":"VPC 网络架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-networking/vpc-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"load-balancing","title":"负载均衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-networking/load-balancing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cdn-edge","title":"CDN 与边缘计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-networking/cdn-edge"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"cloud-storage","title":"云存储","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-storage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"object-storage","title":"对象存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-storage/object-storage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"block-file-storage","title":"块存储与文件存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-storage/block-file-storage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-strategies","title":"云存储策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-computing-fundamentals/cloud-storage/storage-strategies"}]}]}